  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Halve the cherry tomatoes. Slice cucumber into thin sticks. Drain the sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Add the corn kernels and cook until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping” out. Transfer to a medium bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61414dad87a1f91b03254cc4/step-c64af55e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the cherry tomatoes, a drizzle of white wine vinegar, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper to the corn. Toss to combine. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61414dad87a1f91b03254cc4/step-a6587bae.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the large frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook the plant-based pulled beef, until broken down and slightly browned, 3-5 minutes.\n• Add Tex-Mex spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, then stir through the mild chipotle sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61414dad87a1f91b03254cc4/step-cfabe4fe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.\n• Build your tacos by spreading smokey aioli over the base of each tortilla. Top with plant-based meat, cucumber, and corn salsa. Tear over the coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61414dad87a1f91b03254cc4/step-3984a343.jpg"
    }
  ]
